{"book":19,"chapter":16,"rubric":"STORAGE / CHAPTER 16","slides":[{"title":"The three layers of LVM","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Layers","main":"Disk, group, volume: PV, VG and LV.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["PV","VG","LV","oVirt"],"captions":["PV: a disk or partition handed to LVM","VG: a shared reserve of space from several PVs","LV: a block device with a filesystem on it","In oVirt the group sits on a shared disk, a VM disk is an LV"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"physical volume PV: a disk","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"physical volume PV: a disk","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"volume group VG: shared reserve","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"physical volume PV: a disk","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"volume group VG: shared reserve","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"logical volume LV: a device","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"physical volume PV: a disk","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"volume group VG: shared reserve","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"logical volume LV: a device","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"oVirt: VG = domain, LV = VM disk","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[7.7,17.3,26.0]}]},{"title":"Extents and rounding","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Extents","main":"A size is a multiple of the extent, 4 MiB by default.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["PE","LE → PE","Rounding","First MiB"],"captions":["The default physical extent is 4 MiB (physical_extent_size = 4096 KiB)","Each logical extent maps to one physical extent","-L rounds up; -l N% rounds down in lvcreate, up in lvextend","The first MiB of a PV holds label and metadata, slightly fewer extents"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"PE\n4 MiB","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"PE\n4 MiB","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"LE → PE\n1 to 1","tone":"violet","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"violet","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"PE\n4 MiB","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"LE → PE\n1 to 1","tone":"violet","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"violet","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"-L up\n-l % down","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":185.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":46.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"PE\n4 MiB","tone":"blue","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":135.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"LE → PE\n1 to 1","tone":"violet","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a1","x1":85.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":96.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"violet","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":224.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"-L up\n-l % down","tone":"yellow","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a2","x1":174.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":185.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"yellow","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":313.0,"y":70.0,"w":76.0,"h":52.0,"text":"1st MiB:\nlabel","tone":"muted","size":8.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"a3","x1":263.0,"y1":70.0,"x2":274.0,"y2":70.0,"tone":"muted","arrow":true,"width":1.6}]],"cues":[10.3,17.3,26.0]}]},{"title":"Creating","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Creating","main":"pvcreate, vgcreate, lvcreate, mkfs, mount.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["pvcreate","vgcreate","lvcreate","mkfs"],"captions":["pvcreate writes the LVM label on the disks","vgcreate builds the PVs into a group, -s sets the extent size","-L 10G: a size with a binary unit; -l 50%FREE: a share of the free space","Then a filesystem and a mount of /dev/vg0/data"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ pvcreate /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ vgcreate vg0 /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ lvcreate -L 10G -n data vg0","$ lvcreate -l 50%FREE -n logs vg0","$ lvcreate -l 100%FREE -n rest vg0","$ mkfs.xfs /dev/vg0/data","$ mount /dev/vg0/data /srv/data"],"hl":[0],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ pvcreate /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ vgcreate vg0 /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ lvcreate -L 10G -n data vg0","$ lvcreate -l 50%FREE -n logs vg0","$ lvcreate -l 100%FREE -n rest vg0","$ mkfs.xfs /dev/vg0/data","$ mount /dev/vg0/data /srv/data"],"hl":[1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ pvcreate /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ vgcreate vg0 /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ lvcreate -L 10G -n data vg0","$ lvcreate -l 50%FREE -n logs vg0","$ lvcreate -l 100%FREE -n rest vg0","$ mkfs.xfs /dev/vg0/data","$ mount /dev/vg0/data /srv/data"],"hl":[2,3,4],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ pvcreate /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ vgcreate vg0 /dev/sdb /dev/sdc","$ lvcreate -L 10G -n data vg0","$ lvcreate -l 50%FREE -n logs vg0","$ lvcreate -l 100%FREE -n rest vg0","$ mkfs.xfs /dev/vg0/data","$ mount /dev/vg0/data /srv/data"],"hl":[5,6],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[6.8,16.6,28.3]}]},{"title":"Reading lvs and names","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"lvs","main":"Attr, hidden volumes, devices and /dev/mapper.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Command","Attr","Devices","mapper"],"captions":["lvs -a also shows hidden volumes in square brackets","Attr: type in the 1st character, state in the 5th (a active, I invalid)","Devices: which PVs hold the extents and from which number","In /dev/mapper hyphens in names are doubled, the name leads to dm-N"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvs -a -o lv_name,lv_attr,lv_size,devices","  LV     Attr       LSize  Devices","  data   -wi-ao---- 10.00g /dev/sdb(0)","  snap   swi-a-s---  2.00g /dev/sdc(0)","$ ls -l /dev/mapper/my--vg-web","  ... /dev/mapper/my--vg-web -> ../dm-3"],"hl":[0],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvs -a -o lv_name,lv_attr,lv_size,devices","  LV     Attr       LSize  Devices","  data   -wi-ao---- 10.00g /dev/sdb(0)","  snap   swi-a-s---  2.00g /dev/sdc(0)","$ ls -l /dev/mapper/my--vg-web","  ... /dev/mapper/my--vg-web -> ../dm-3"],"hl":[1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvs -a -o lv_name,lv_attr,lv_size,devices","  LV     Attr       LSize  Devices","  data   -wi-ao---- 10.00g /dev/sdb(0)","  snap   swi-a-s---  2.00g /dev/sdc(0)","$ ls -l /dev/mapper/my--vg-web","  ... /dev/mapper/my--vg-web -> ../dm-3"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvs -a -o lv_name,lv_attr,lv_size,devices","  LV     Attr       LSize  Devices","  data   -wi-ao---- 10.00g /dev/sdb(0)","  snap   swi-a-s---  2.00g /dev/sdc(0)","$ ls -l /dev/mapper/my--vg-web","  ... /dev/mapper/my--vg-web -> ../dm-3"],"hl":[4,5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[7.7,18.5,27.1]}]},{"title":"Extending and reducing","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Resizing","main":"Growing is live, shrinking is dangerous.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["vgextend","lvextend -r","XFS","lvreduce"],"captions":["vgextend adds a disk to the group when free extents run out","lvextend -L +5G -r vg0/data grows the volume and the filesystem (fsadm)","ext4 and XFS grow mounted; XFS cannot shrink, ext4 only unmounted","lvreduce cuts extents from the end: filesystem first, then volume, and a backup"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vgextend\nnew PV","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vgextend\nnew PV","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"lvextend -r\nLV + FS","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vgextend\nnew PV","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"lvextend -r\nLV + FS","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"XFS: grow\nonly","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vgextend\nnew PV","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"lvextend -r\nLV + FS","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"XFS: grow\nonly","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":265.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"lvreduce:\nFS, then LV","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[7.5,16.6,24.9]}]},{"title":"pvmove and retiring a disk","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"pvmove","main":"Moving extents, vgreduce, pvremove; striping and mirroring.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["pvmove","Resume","Retire","Placement"],"captions":["pvmove /dev/sdb moves the allocated extents to other PVs of the group","An interrupted pvmove is resumed by running pvmove with no arguments","Retire an empty PV: vgreduce vg0 /dev/sdb, then pvremove","lvcreate -i 2 stripes over two PVs; --type raid1 -m 1 keeps two copies"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"pvmove /dev/sdb: the move","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"pvmove /dev/sdb: the move","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"interrupted? pvmove, no arguments","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"pvmove /dev/sdb: the move","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"interrupted? pvmove, no arguments","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"vgreduce vg0 /dev/sdb; pvremove","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"pvmove /dev/sdb: the move","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"interrupted? pvmove, no arguments","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"vgreduce vg0 /dev/sdb; pvremove","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"-i N: stripes; raid1 -m 1: copies","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.7,21.3,30.0]}]},{"title":"The classic snapshot","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Snapshot","main":"Copy-on-write and the invalid snapshot.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Create","COW","Full","Merge"],"captions":["lvcreate -s -L 2G sets the COW area size, 20% of the volume is often enough","A write to an origin block copies the old data into the snapshot area","At 100% Data: Attr gets I, the snapshot is useless, reads give errors","lvconvert --mergesnapshot rolls the origin back to the snapshot state"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -s -L 2G -n snap vg0/data","$ lvs -o lv_name,lv_attr,origin,data_percent","  LV   Attr       Origin Data%","  data owi-aos---","  snap swi-a-s--- data     3.20","  snap swi-I-s--- data   100.00","$ lvconvert --mergesnapshot vg0/snap"],"hl":[0],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -s -L 2G -n snap vg0/data","$ lvs -o lv_name,lv_attr,origin,data_percent","  LV   Attr       Origin Data%","  data owi-aos---","  snap swi-a-s--- data     3.20","  snap swi-I-s--- data   100.00","$ lvconvert --mergesnapshot vg0/snap"],"hl":[1,2,3,4],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -s -L 2G -n snap vg0/data","$ lvs -o lv_name,lv_attr,origin,data_percent","  LV   Attr       Origin Data%","  data owi-aos---","  snap swi-a-s--- data     3.20","  snap swi-I-s--- data   100.00","$ lvconvert --mergesnapshot vg0/snap"],"hl":[5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -s -L 2G -n snap vg0/data","$ lvs -o lv_name,lv_attr,origin,data_percent","  LV   Attr       Origin Data%","  data owi-aos---","  snap swi-a-s--- data     3.20","  snap swi-I-s--- data   100.00","$ lvconvert --mergesnapshot vg0/snap"],"hl":[6],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[10.6,20.3,30.0]}]},{"title":"The thin pool","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Thin","main":"Shared data and metadata, virtual sizes.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Pool","Hidden","Thin volume","Data/Meta"],"captions":["lvcreate -L 100G -T vg0/pool: a pool of a data volume and a metadata volume","_tdata and _tmeta show in lvs -a, they are ordinary volumes of the group","-V 200G -T: a virtual size above the pool, space is taken as data is written","Do not let Data% and Meta% reach 100%: extend the pool early"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -L 100G -T vg0/pool","$ lvcreate -V 200G -T vg0/pool -n web","  LV           Attr       LSize   Data%  Meta%","  pool         twi-aotz-- 100.00g 41.20   3.10","  [pool_tdata] Twi-ao---- 100.00g","  [pool_tmeta] ewi-ao---- 104.00m","  web          Vwi-aotz-- 200.00g 20.60"],"hl":[0],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -L 100G -T vg0/pool","$ lvcreate -V 200G -T vg0/pool -n web","  LV           Attr       LSize   Data%  Meta%","  pool         twi-aotz-- 100.00g 41.20   3.10","  [pool_tdata] Twi-ao---- 100.00g","  [pool_tmeta] ewi-ao---- 104.00m","  web          Vwi-aotz-- 200.00g 20.60"],"hl":[4,5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -L 100G -T vg0/pool","$ lvcreate -V 200G -T vg0/pool -n web","  LV           Attr       LSize   Data%  Meta%","  pool         twi-aotz-- 100.00g 41.20   3.10","  [pool_tdata] Twi-ao---- 100.00g","  [pool_tmeta] ewi-ao---- 104.00m","  web          Vwi-aotz-- 200.00g 20.60"],"hl":[1,6],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ lvcreate -L 100G -T vg0/pool","$ lvcreate -V 200G -T vg0/pool -n web","  LV           Attr       LSize   Data%  Meta%","  pool         twi-aotz-- 100.00g 41.20   3.10","  [pool_tdata] Twi-ao---- 100.00g","  [pool_tmeta] ewi-ao---- 104.00m","  web          Vwi-aotz-- 200.00g 20.60"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[10.8,21.2,32.1]}]},{"title":"Metadata, activation, filters","sub":"Chapter 16 · Storage","short":"Metada